Description: A remote shell for development over SSH
 fil keeps your place on a remote host: sessions survive reconnects, roaming and
 sleep, you can take one over from another machine, and port forwards outlive the
 link. It runs over ssh, or directly over QUIC. The package installs the static
 fil binary and the remote bundle (both Linux architectures) that fil install uploads.
